raw_source_record.full_rules_text:
Upgrade Sword to its normal version instead of Iron Sword Body. Use the normal sphere key ability and options.

Owner ruling: 2026-10-22. Printed record:
#### Sword-Body Adept

Prerequisite: Body Refining, Sword sphere, CL 4+

Your body and blade circulate as one scripture.

Gain:

access to Sword Beyond Hand using Stamina;

use Constitution for Sword attack and damage rolls if higher;

use Constitution as your Sword key ability;

gain Advantage on one saving throw against Disarm per short rest.
